codemirror.bundle.js — prebuilt ESM bundle of CodeMirror 6 and its
dependencies, produced by scripts/vendor/codemirror/ (see the README there
for the exact reproducible build commands).

Every bundled package is MIT-licensed. Bundled packages and versions:

    @codemirror/autocomplete@6.20.3
    @codemirror/commands@6.10.4
    @codemirror/lang-css@6.3.1
    @codemirror/lang-html@6.4.11
    @codemirror/lang-javascript@6.2.5
    @codemirror/lang-markdown@6.5.1
    @codemirror/language@6.12.4
    @codemirror/state@6.7.1
    @codemirror/view@6.43.7
    @lezer/common@1.5.2
    @lezer/css@1.3.4
    @lezer/highlight@1.2.3
    @lezer/html@1.3.13
    @lezer/javascript@1.5.4
    @lezer/lr@1.4.10
    @lezer/markdown@1.7.2
    @marijn/find-cluster-break@1.0.3
    crelt@1.0.7
    style-mod@4.1.3
    w3c-keyname@2.2.8

Built with esbuild@0.28.1 (build tool only; no esbuild code in the bundle).

